# Commits

Pull requests squash onto `main`. The pull request title is the commit message.

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`.

```
feat: add login page
fix: prevent duplicate vehicle rows
docs: explain RV vehicle pass rule
chore: upgrade vite
refactor: split accommodations into folder
```

One behavior per pull request. CI must be green before merge. Agent-instruction changes ship in the repository — never keep rules only on the local machine.
